			"notes": "Vintner 1.2.0 — Cellar and Identity\\n\\nThis release delivers the completed Phase 3 cellar and identity scope:\\n\\n- Persistent wine provenance, estate identity, styles, quality scoring, tasting profiles, estimated value, and cellar prestige.\\n- Oak, toasted, seasoned, and large-cask ageing profiles with expanded cellar conditions.\\n- Vintage Archives, barrel stands, Labelled Cellar Shelves, and Tasting Cabinets.\\n- Twelve supported wood-family variants and wood-preserving cooperage upgrades.\\n\\nValidation:\\n- 77 required GameTests passed.\\n- Resource audit passed across 1,089 JSON files, 123 public wood-family blocks, and 24 wood-preserving grapevine states.\\n- Fresh dedicated server reached ready state, saved all dimensions, and shut down cleanly.\\n\\nArtifact SHA-256: 513a618d35aac75db14b066e3f7bcb35302aec100acc7e17ab3fc27021173869"
