			"notes": "Vintner 1.0.1 is a focused hotfix for stacked vineyard rows and grapevine\ninteraction.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Two-block trellis rows now render wires and end braces only on the correct\n  level.\n- One-block and two-block trellis rows no longer form partial connections.\n- Grapevines now have compact selection outlines without changing the trellis\n  collision structure.\n- Breaking either half of a grapevine removes the vine while preserving both\n  supporting trellises.\n- Removed grapevines now drop the matching red or white grape cutting.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.155.2+26.2\n- Java 25\n\n## Validation\n\n- Clean production build\n- All 22 required automated gameplay tests passed\n- In-game visual and interaction QA for stacked trellises, vine hitboxes,\n  vine-only breaking, trellis restoration, and drops\n\nSHA-256:\n`b3677cf0f66512b27f6a43af55f1711f92b5d2e53a7c9520f6fc2def2db90b8b`"
		},
