			"notes": "Vintner 1.0.0 is the first public release of a complete vineyard and\nwinemaking progression for Fabric.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Build connected, two-block vineyard rows with automatic end braces.\n- Grow red and white grapevines from cuttings, harvest mature canopies, and\n  prune established vines for renewable planting material.\n- Prepare vineyard soil and evaluate conditions that influence grape quality.\n- Press grapes into must, ferment wine, and improve it through barrel aging.\n- Discover starter cuttings through farmers, wandering traders, and village\n  house chests.\n- Follow a complete advancement path from the first cutting to cellar mastery.\n- Use machine status feedback, visual batch states, and comparator output.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.155.2+26.2\n- Java 25\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall Fabric Loader and Fabric API, then place `vintner-1.0.0.jar` in the\nMinecraft `mods` folder.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Clean production build\n- 19 passing automated gameplay tests\n- Fresh dedicated survival server startup and clean shutdown\n- Full model, texture, advancement, recipe, and loot resource loading\n\nSHA-256:\n`708aef3cd881fdb6298ad07f43a69cff6fd2d2cad26ebdbf9a4159487ae66601`"
